                    "settings": {
                        "html": "<section class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"pv-wrap\"><p class=\"kicker\">Universe timeline</p><h1>Six nights changed Meridian.</h1></div></section><section class=\"page-section\"><div class=\"pv-wrap timeline\"><article class=\"timeline-item\" data-year=\"DAY 0\"><h3>The hidden signal</h3><p>Nova Circuit detects impossible geometry inside the city's solar grid.</p></article><article class=\"timeline-item\" data-year=\"DAY 1\"><h3>The fracture</h3><p>Three realities overlap at sunset; transit and communication fail.</p></article><article class=\"timeline-item\" data-year=\"DAY 2\"><h3>First alliance</h3><p>Rift Runner and Vanta Echo rescue commuters trapped between dimensions.</p></article><article class=\"timeline-item\" data-year=\"DAY 3\"><h3>The Crown speaks</h3><p>The Dominion offers safety in exchange for permanent control.</p></article><article class=\"timeline-item\" data-year=\"DAY 5\"><h3>Red Static</h3><p>A pirate signal amplifies fear and fractures the new alliance.</p></article><article class=\"timeline-item\" data-year=\"DAY 6\"><h3>Open future</h3><p>The team restores separate horizons while preserving a narrow bridge between worlds.</p></article></div></section>"
